title: SHOP
---
<<set $MapSwitchFlag = true>>
<<declare $UsedCard = false>>
<<declare $UsedRepair = false>>
<<declare $UsedUpgrade = false>>            
What do you want? [pos]({$CompanyCredit} Company Credit on Account)[/pos]
       -> I require more Weapons [Risk](1 CC)[/Risk]
              <<if $CompanyCredit == 0>>
                     You have no Company Credit on your account, I'm afraid we can't allocate more resources to you until you gain more
                     <<jump SHOP>>
              <<endif>>
              <<if $UsedCard == false>>
                  What do you need? [Risk](Costs 1 Company Credit)[/Risk]
                     -> I need [PHY]Physical Prowess[/PHY]
                            <<RewardCards GameManagerObject 8 3 0>>
                            <<set $UsedCard to true>>
                            <<set $CompanyCredit -= 1>>
                            <<jump SHOP>>
                     -> I need [HACK]Hacking Capabilities[/HACK]
                            <<RewardCards GameManagerObject 8 3 1>>
                            <<set $UsedCard to true>>
                            <<set $CompanyCredit -= 1>>
                            <<jump SHOP>>
                     -> I need [MULT]Multipliers[/MULT]
                            <<RewardCards GameManagerObject 8 3 2>>
                            <<set $UsedCard to true>>
                            <<set $CompanyCredit -= 1>>
                            <<jump SHOP>>
                     -> I need [RUST]Rust[/RUST]
                            <<RewardCards GameManagerObject 8 3 3>>
                            <<set $UsedCard to true>>
                            <<set $CompanyCredit -= 1>>
                            <<jump SHOP>>
                     -> Any is Fine
                            <<RewardCards GameManagerObject 8 3>>
                            <<set $UsedCard to true>>
                            <<set $CompanyCredit -= 1>>
                            <<jump SHOP>>
                     -> nevermind
                            <<jump SHOP>>
              <<endif>>
              We have given you all that we can in regards to Weapons.
              <<jump SHOP>>
              
       -> I require Repairs [Risk](1 CC)[/Risk]
              <<if $CompanyCredit == 0>>
                     You have no Company Credit on your account, I'm afraid we can't allocate more resources to you until you gain more
                     <<jump SHOP>>
              <<endif>>
              <<if $UsedRepair == false>>
                     We have limited Capacity here, what specifically do you need repaired? [Risk](Costs 1 Company Credit)[/Risk]
                            -> Shields //repairs Shields by 50%
                                   <<RepairMech GameManagerObject 2 50>>
                                   <<set $CompanyCredit -= 1>>
                                   <<set $UsedRepair = true>>
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
                            -> Armor //repairs Armor by 30%
                                   <<RepairMech GameManagerObject 1 50>>
                                   <<set $CompanyCredit -= 1>>
                                   <<set $UsedRepair = true>>
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
                            -> Hull // repairs Hull by 100%
                                   <<RepairMech GameManagerObject 0 100>>
                                   <<set $CompanyCredit -= 1>>
                                   <<set $UsedRepair = true>>
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
                            -> Nevermind
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
              <<endif>>
              We don't have more Resources at this Shop for more Repairs.
              <<jump SHOP>>
       -> I need Upgrades [Risk](2 CC)[/Risk]
              <<if $CompanyCredit < 2>>
                     You have no Company Credit on your account, I'm afraid we can't allocate more resources to you until you gain more
                     <<jump SHOP>>
              <<endif>>
              <<if $UsedUpgrade == false>>
                     We have limited Capacity here, what do you want to upgrade? [Risk](Costs 2 Company Credit)[/Risk]
                            -> Discards // Upgrade your Amount of Turnly discards
                                   <<DiscardGain GameManagerObject 2>>
                                   <<set $UsedUpgrade = true>>
                                   <<set $CompanyCredit -= 2>>
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
                            -> Energy // Gain one extra energy
                                   <<EnergyGain GameManagerObject 1>>
                                   <<set $UsedUpgrade = true>>
                                   <<set $CompanyCredit -= 2>>
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
                            -> Armor and Shield (50% Increase) // Either multiply by 150% or add half of what current HP is to Mech Armor
                                   <<UpgradeMechHp GameManagerObject 1 1.5>>
                                   <<UpgradeMechHp GameManagerObject 2 1.5>>
                                   <<set $UsedUpgrade = true>>
                                   <<set $CompanyCredit -= 2>>
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
                            -> Hull (100% Increase)// Double Hull  
                                   <<UpgradeMechHp GameManagerObject 0 2>>  
                                   <<set $UsedUpgrade = true>>
                                   <<set $CompanyCredit -= 2>>
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
                            -> Nevermind
                                   <<jump SHOP>>
              <<endif>>
              That's all the Upgrades we can do right now
              <<jump SHOP>>       
       -> *Leave*
              <<set $UsedCard = false>>
              <<set $UsedRepair = false>>
              <<set $UsedUpgrade = false>>  
===
title: EmptyNode
